 left side of the frame, looking forward. <Subject 2> (S2), the elder with the grey beard, is positioned slightly behind and to the right of <Subject 1>, observing the scene. <Subject 3> (S3), the girl with silver hair, is situated in the center foreground, facing the viewer. The lighting is warm and diffused, suggesting a pleasant day. <Subject 1> (S1) steps slightly forward and speaks in a composed manner guided by <Audio 1>, saying, <d>[Chinese] 你好</d>. Immediately following, <Subject 2> (S2) turns his head slightly towards <Subject 1> and responds in a thoughtful tone guided by <Audio 2>, saying, <d>[Chinese] 好久不见</d>. Then, <Subject 3> (S3) smiles brightly and addresses the viewer, speaking in a cheerful voice guided by <Audio 3>, saying, <d>[Chinese] 大家好啊</d>. The camera executes a very slow, subtle dolly zoom outwards during <Subject 3>'s line, allowing all three subjects to be visible in a balanced composition before holding steady until the video concludes.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe ambient sound includes a gentle, warm outdoor atmosphere, such as distant, soft wind rustling through leaves, combined with the quiet, muffled sounds of footsteps on stone paving.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA mellow acoustic guitar melody played at a moderate tempo, featuring warm, sustained chords that swell slightly during the dialogue exchanges."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [336.87286376953125, 159.29336547851562], "pos": [980.9295043945312, 1571.011474609375], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [30], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [1342.880004